From: postmaster@${DOMAIN}
To: ${USER_EMAIL}
Subject: Welcome! Corporate Email Setup and Configuration Guide
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 20px; background-color: #f8fafc; }
  .card { border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); }
  .header { border-bottom: 2px solid #3182ce; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .header h2 { color: #2b6cb0; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
  .step-box { background: #f7fafc; border-left: 4px solid #3182ce; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
  code { background: #edf2f7; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: Consolas, monospace; color: #c53030; font-size: 0.95em; }
  .info-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  .info-table td { padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7; font-size: 0.95em; }
  .info-table td:first-child { width: 35%; font-weight: 600; color: #4a5568; }
  ol { padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .footer { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 0.85em; color: #718096; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 16px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="header">
    <h2>🎉 Welcome aboard! Corporate Email Configuration Guide</h2>
  </div>
  <p>Dear <strong>${USER_NAME}</strong>,</p>
  <p>Your corporate email account <code>${USER_EMAIL}</code> has been successfully activated! Please refer to the server connection settings below to configure your email client (such as Outlook, Thunderbird, or mobile mail apps).</p>

  <div class="step-box">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#2d3748; font-size:16px;">📌 Server Connection Details</h3>
    <table class="info-table">
      <tr>
        <td>Full Email Address</td>
        <td><code>${USER_EMAIL}</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Account Username</td>
        <td><code>${USER_NAME}</code> (or full email)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Password</td>
        <td>Your Windows AD domain password</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Incoming Server (IMAP)</td>
        <td><code>${MAIL_SERVER}</code> (Port <code>993</code> / SSL/TLS)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Outgoing Server (SMTP)</td>
        <td><code>${MAIL_SERVER}</code> (Port <code>465</code> or <code>587</code> / SSL/TLS)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Outgoing Authentication</td>
        <td>Required (Same as incoming AD credentials)</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="step-box">
    <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#2d3748; font-size:16px;">📖 Quick Client Setup Instructions</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Add Account:</strong> Open Outlook, Thunderbird, or your mobile mail app, select "Add Account" and enter your full email address <code>${USER_EMAIL}</code>.</li>
      <li><strong>Select Protocol:</strong> Choose <strong>IMAP</strong> as your account type for seamless multi-device synchronization.</li>
      <li><strong>Configure Server Details:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Incoming Mail Server (IMAP):</strong> Set Hostname to <code>${MAIL_SERVER}</code>, Port to <code>993</code>, and Security/Encryption to <code>SSL/TLS</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Outgoing Mail Server (SMTP):</strong> Set Hostname to <code>${MAIL_SERVER}</code>, Port to <code>465</code> (or <code>587</code>), and Security/Encryption to <code>SSL/TLS</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Ensure "My outgoing server (SMTP) requires authentication" is checked, using the same credentials as your incoming mail server.</li>
      <li><strong>Complete Setup:</strong> Test the connection and you are ready to send and receive corporate emails!</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>💡 This automated message was sent by the onboarding provisioning system. If you need assistance, please contact the IT Service Desk.</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
